---
title: "OpenAPI Worker per-call identity and credential resolution"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Request
    lg1: Authorizing
    lg2: Credential missing
    lg3: Denied
    lg4: Dispatched
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 purple
  class lg4 teal
  s0: Request received
  s1: Caller authenticated
  s2: Instance selected
  s3: Published snapshot loaded
  s4: Instance denied
  s5: Operation checked
  s6: Credential context checked
  s7: Caller credential ready
  s8: Authorization required
  s9: Sent to worker
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the platform identifies the caller
  s1 --> s2: the request names an instance
  s2 --> s3: instance ownership and profile pass
  s2 --> s4: instance ownership or profile fails
  s3 --> s5: the published snapshot and original tool are loaded
  s5 --> s6: tool authorization passes
  s6 --> s7: a valid credential is found for the exact instance
  s6 --> s8: the exact instance credential is missing or invalid
  s7 --> s9: the request is sent to the worker
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 yellow
  class s3 yellow
  class s4 purple
  class s5 yellow
  class s6 yellow
  class s7 yellow
  class s8 orange
  class s9 teal
